---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Contatti e collaborazioni | Front-end Developer Luca Sanna"
  description="Contatta Luca Sanna per collaborazioni di sviluppo front-end, UI engineering e progettazione di prodotti digitali, anche da remoto."
  canonical="https://www.lucasanna.eu/contatti/"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="contenuto">
    <section class="contact-hero">
      <div class="container-unified">
        <p class="contact-eyebrow">Collaborazioni / Contatti</p>
        <h1>Parliamo del prossimo progetto.</h1>
        <p class="contact-lead">Cerchi una persona che sappia portare un'interfaccia dal concept al codice? Mi interessano collaborazioni con team di prodotto, software house e agenzie digitali.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="contact-section">
      <div class="container-unified contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-primary">
          <p class="contact-label">Il canale migliore</p>
          <h2>Scrivimi via email.</h2>
          <p>Raccontami brevemente il prodotto, il team, il ruolo che stai cercando e le modalità di collaborazione. Preferisco iniziare con una conversazione chiara sul problema da risolvere.</p>
          <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:info@lucasanna.eu?subject=Proposta%20di%20collaborazione%20front-end">info@lucasanna.eu ↗</a>
          <p class="contact-location">Sassari, Italia · Disponibile a valutare collaborazioni da remoto.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="contact-side" aria-label="Altri collegamenti">
          <h2>Esplora il mio lavoro</h2>
          <a href="/progetti/"><span>01</span> Progetti e case study ↗</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/LucaSannadesign" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>02</span> GitHub ↗</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lucasanna-art/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>03</span> LinkedIn ↗</a>
          <a href="/chi-sono/"><span>04</span> Profilo professionale ↗</a>
          <div class="contact-note">
            <h3>Cerchi invece un servizio web per la tua azienda?</h3>
            <p>Le richieste commerciali per siti, consulenze e progetti aziendali sono gestite attraverso LS Web Agency.</p>
            <a href="https://www.lswebagency.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vai a LS Web Agency ↗</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
<style>
.contact-hero{padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,8rem) 0 4rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 85% 16%,rgb(var(--accent)/.08),transparent 42%)}
.contact-eyebrow,.contact-label{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgb(var(--accent));font-weight:700}
.contact-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.9rem,6.5vw,6rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.055em;max-width:13ch;margin:1.2rem 0;color:rgb(var(--ink))}
.contact-lead{color:rgb(var(--muted));font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.4rem);line-height:1.65;max-width:61ch}
.contact-section{padding:2rem 0 8rem}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(260px,.7fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,8rem)}
.contact-primary,.contact-side{border-top:1px solid rgb(var(--border)/.35);padding-top:2rem}
.contact-primary h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:rgb(var(--ink));margin:1rem 0 1.2rem}
.contact-primary>p:not(.contact-label){font-size:1.07rem;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(var(--muted));max-width:57ch}
.contact-email{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3.2vw,2.4rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.035em;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(var(--ink));padding:1.5rem 0 .4rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgb(var(--accent));overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.contact-primary>.contact-location{font-size:.9rem!important;margin-top:2.2rem}
.contact-side h2{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:rgb(var(--ink));margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.contact-side>a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(var(--border)/.25);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(var(--ink))}
.contact-side>a span{font-size:.7rem;color:rgb(var(--accent));font-weight:700}
.contact-note{padding:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem;background:rgb(var(--surface));border:1px solid rgb(var(--border)/.25);border-radius:.8rem}
.contact-note h3{font-size:1.04rem;font-weight:700;color:rgb(var(--ink));margin-bottom:.8rem}
.contact-note p{font-size:.87rem;color:rgb(var(--muted));line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:1rem}
.contact-note a{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(var(--ink));border-bottom:1px solid rgb(var(--accent));padding-bottom:.2rem}
.contact-section a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid rgb(var(--accent));outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:730px){.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contact-section{padding-bottom:4rem}}
</style>
